WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.092
Welcome to Module 13. Here we connect statistics with visualization and interpretation.

00:00:06.092 --> 00:00:11.437
We will summarize center and spread, examine distributions, compare groups,

00:00:11.437 --> 00:00:17.137
discuss correlation and uncertainty, and choose visual forms that fit the analytical question.

00:00:17.137 --> 00:00:25.617
Choose the visual based on the question: bars for categories, lines for time, histograms for distributions,

00:00:25.617 --> 00:00:27.894
and scatter plots for relationships.
